"phone": "+34 638 231 622",
"guide": "Manned Photogrammetric Flight Permit\n\nDownload and fill the official application form from the IGN:\n\nDefine the mission scope clearly, including equipment (camera/sensor, height, overlaps, GSD).\n\nThe form and procedure are published on the IGN website \n\nhttps://www.ign.es/web/permiso-vuelo-fotogrametrico\n\nInclude a croquis on MTN 1:25,000 indicating the sheet number, area polygon, UTM or geographic coordinates, and flight lines\n\nSubmission\n\nSubmit form and map to Registro Central de Cartografía (RCC) via email:\nrcc@transportes.gob.es \nign.es\n.\n\nRestricted Zone Handling\n\nRCC checks for Zonas Reservadas al Vuelo Fotogramétrico (ZRVF). \nIf found, RCC forwards to CECAF, who grants permission and contacts applicant. It is not needed to contact CECAF directly.\n\nAirspace Coordination\n\nFor operations in controlled airspace, coordinate separately in parallel via ENAIRE’s “Planea” platform.\n\nhttps://planea.enaire.es/\n\nENAIRE Typical timeline: 10 days, or up to 20 days in complex zones near airports.",
"docs": "Pilot(s)’ licenses\n\nAircraft registration\n\nAirworthiness certificate (ARC)\n\nOperator’s declaration (AESA/EASA, EU Reg. 965/2012)\n\nLiability insurance\n\nRadio station license\n\n(If ZRVF applies): additional information as requested by CECAF",
"lead": null,
"form": "https://www.ign.es/web/resources/docs/IGNCnig/Impreso_vuelos_fotogrametricos.pdf",
"restricted": null,
"restrictedForm": "https://insignia.enaire.es/",
