"authority": "Ministry of Defense of Republic of Serbia",
"web": "https://www.mod.gov.rs/eng/16744/postupak-za-podnosenje-zahteva-za-izdavanje-odobrenja-za-snimanje-iz-vazduha-teritorije-republike-srbije-16744",
"contact": "info@mod.gov.rs",
"submission": "gt.ckkt@vs.rs",
"online": null,
"viaEmail": false,
"phone": "+381 11/2063-897",
"guide": "•\tApplication should be submitted to Ministry of Defense of Republic of Serbia\n•\tDetails about application are given at website: https://www.mod.gov.rs/eng/16744/postupak-za-podnosenje-zahteva-za-izdavanje-odobrenja-za-snimanje-iz-vazduha-teritorije-republike-srbije-16744\n•\tDocument at this link attached to this email (PDF)\n•\tNote: flight permission may be granted ONLY to state institutions, companies or other legal entities REGISTERED IN THE REPUBLIC OF SERBIA. In other words, application must be submitted not by flying company (EAASI member), but Serbian legal entity.\n•\tMinistry will forward request to Civil Aviation Directorate (CAD) for internal approval\n•\tSeparate application must be submitted to Civil Aviation Directorate only if one would fly within LY R8 zone (restricted zone, KMZ in attachment). More information (in Serbian, to be translated): http://demo.paragraf.rs/demo/combined/Old/t/t2014_07/t07_0263.htm \n•\tBoundary of LY R8 restricted zone given in attachment (KMZ)",
"docs": "Application to CAD should be sent to flight-permissions@cad.gov.rs with the following information:\n•\tcertificate of competence for providing aerial services \n•\tflight personnel licenses for aircraft crew members\n•\taircraft registration certificate\n•\tairworthiness certificate and valid aircraft airworthiness review certificate\n•\tinsurance certificate on liability for damage caused to passengers and third parties\n•\tlicense to operate a radio station.",
"lead": 15,
"form": "https://www.mod.gov.rs/eng/16744/postupak-za-podnosenje-zahteva-za-izdavanje-odobrenja-za-snimanje-iz-vazduha-teritorije-republike-srbije-16744",
